1:0000ff660000000085:000000810000000089:3c4200008181423c8a:003c00187e5a24008p:00000000002418005 WELCOME TO PICOPIX

picopix is a utility for generat-
ing colored one-off characters 
using P8SCII. You can freely 
create, save, and load one-off 
characters with ease.

This software is compatible with 
any text fields where copy-pasted
P8SCII is accepted.


